fragment_downloaded_cb({"url":"gstreamer/gstmeta.html#gst_meta_api_type_set_params_aggregator","fragment":"\n\tgst_meta_api_type_set_params_aggregator\n\n\n\tGst.prototype.meta_api_type_set_params_aggregator\n\n\n\tGst.meta_api_type_set_params_aggregator\n\nThis function sets the aggregator function for a specific API type.\nParameters:\nthe GType of the API for which the aggregator function is being set.\nthe aggregator function to be associated with the given API\ntype.\n\n\tSince\t\t\t: 1.26\n\t\t\nThis function sets the aggregator function for a specific API type.\nParameters:\nthe GObject.Type of the API for which the aggregator function is being set.\nthe aggregator function to be associated with the given API\ntype.\n\n\tSince\t\t\t: 1.26\n\t\t\nThis function sets the aggregator function for a specific API type.\nParameters:\nthe GObject.Type of the API for which the aggregator function is being set.\nthe aggregator function to be associated with the given API\ntype.\n\n\tSince\t\t\t: 1.26\n\t\t\n"});